","pinyin":"Jiāojìng Guó","aliases":[],"category":"nation","tags":["交胫"],"brief":"海外南方之国，其民双腿相互交叉弯曲，卧则须扶而后起。","chapter":"haiwainan","locationId":"jiaojing-guo","image":"jiaojing-hu","imageCount":1},{"id":"busimin","name":"不死民","nameTrad":"不死民","pinyin":"Bùsǐmín","aliases":[],"category":"nation","tags":["不死"],"brief":"海外南方之国，其民肤色黝黑，寿考不死；《大荒南经》谓其国阿姓，食甘木（不死树）。","chapter":"haiwainan","locationId":"busi-min","image":"busimin-tushu","imageCount":1},{"id":"sanshou","name":"三首国","nameTrad":"三首國","pinyin":"Sānshǒu Guó","aliases":[],"category":"nation","tags":["一身三首"],"brief":"海外南方之国，其民一身而三头。","chapter":"haiwainan","locationId":"sanshou-guo","image":"sanshou-hu","imageCount":2},{"id":"zhourao","name":"周饶国","nameTrad":"周饒國","pinyin":"Zhōuráo Guó","aliases":["焦侥国","小人国"],"category":"nation","tags":["小人"],"brief":"海外南方的小人国，其民身材短小而衣冠齐整，居于山洞，能造机巧器物。","chapter":"haiwainan","locationId":"zhourao-guo","image":"zhourao-tushu","imageCount":1},{"id":"changbi","name":"长臂国","nameTrad":"長臂國","pinyin":"Chángbì Guó","aliases":[],"category":"nation","tags":["长臂"],"brief":"海外南方之国，其民手臂奇长，立于水中两手各捉一鱼。","chapter":"haiwainan","locationId":"changbi-guo","image":"changbi-hu","imageCount":2},{"id":"zhurong","name":"祝融","nameTrad":"祝融","pinyin":"Zhùróng","aliases":[],"category":"deity","tags":["火神","南方之神"],"brief":"南方之神、火神，兽身人面，乘两龙；《海内经》记其奉帝命杀鲧于羽郊，后世祀于南岳衡山祝融峰。","chapter":"haiwainan","locationId":"zhurong-feng","image":"zhurong-jiang","imageCount":2},{"id":"sanshen","name":"三身国","nameTrad":"三身國","pinyin":"Sānshēn Guó","aliases":[],"category":"nation","tags":["一首三身","帝俊之裔"],"brief":"海外西方之国，其民一头三身；《大荒南经》谓帝俊妻娥皇生此国，姚姓。","chapter":"haiwaixi","locationId":"sanshen-guo","image":"sanshen-hu","imageCount":2},{"id":"qigong","name":"奇肱国","nameTrad":"奇肱國","pinyin":"Qígōng Guó","aliases":[],"category":"nation","tags":["一臂三目","机巧"],"brief":"海外西方之国，其民独臂三目，乘文马；郭璞注谓其民善造机巧，曾作飞车乘风远行。","chapter":"haiwaixi","locationId":"qigong-guo","image":"qigong-hu","imageCount":2},{"id":"xingtian","name":"刑天","nameTrad":"刑天","pinyin":"Xíngtiān","aliases":["形天"],"category":"deity","tags":["战神","不屈"],"brief":"与天帝争神之神。帝断其首葬于常羊之山，刑天以双乳为目、以肚脐为口，操盾持斧继续挥舞——陶渊明咏「刑天舞干戚，猛志固常在」即此。","chapter":"haiwaixi","locationId":"changyang","image":"xingtian-hu","imageCount":1},{"id":"nvchou","name":"女丑之尸","nameTrad":"女丑之尸","pinyin":"Nǚchǒu zhī Shī","aliases":[],"category":"deity","tags":["暴巫求雨"],"brief":"生前为女巫，十个太阳的炎热将她炙杀于山顶，死时以右手遮面；古人暴巫求雨之俗的神话投影。","chapter":"haiwaixi","locationId":"nvchou-shan","image":null,"imageCount":0},{"id":"wuxian","name":"巫咸国","nameTrad":"巫咸國","pinyin":"Wūxián Guó","aliases":[],"category":"nation","tags":["群巫","登葆山"],"brief":"海外西方群巫之国，巫者右手操青蛇、左手操赤蛇，从登葆山上下于天，采药通神。","chapter":"haiwaixi","locationId":"dengbao","image":"wuxian-tushu","imageCount":1},{"id":"bingfeng","name":"并封","nameTrad":"并封","pinyin":"Bìngfēng","aliases":[],"category":"beast","tags":["前后有首"],"brief":"巫咸国以东的怪兽，状如黑猪，前后皆有头。闻一多谓其为雌雄合体之象。","chapter":"haiwaixi","locationId":"bingfeng-ye","image":"bingfeng-hu","imageCount":2},{"id":"xuanyuan-guo","name":"轩辕国","nameTrad":"軒轅國","pinyin":"Xuānyuán Guó","aliases":[],"category":"nation","tags":["人面蛇身","长寿"],"brief":"海外西方之国，居穷山之际，其民人面蛇身、尾盘于头顶，最短寿者也活八百岁。","chapter":"haiwaixi","locationId":"xuanyuan-guo","image":null,"imageCount":0},{"id":"baimin","name":"白民国","nameTrad":"白民國","pinyin":"Báimín Guó","aliases":[],"category":"nation","tags":["白身被发"],"brief":"海外西方之国，其民通体雪白、披发；国中出神兽乘黄。","chapter":"haiwaixi","locationId":"baimin-guo","image":null,"imageCount":0},{"id":"chenghuang","name":"乘黄","nameTrad":"乘黃","pinyin":"Chénghuáng","aliases":["飞黄"],"category":"beast","tags":["瑞兽","乘之寿千岁"],"brief":"白民国神兽，状如狐，背上生角；乘之可寿两千岁。「飞黄腾达」之飞黄即由此演出。","chapter":"haiwaixi","locationId":"baimin-guo","image":"chenghuang-hu","imageCount":2},{"id":"sushen","name":"肃慎国","nameTrad":"肅慎國","pinyin":"Sùshèn Guó","aliases":[],"category":"nation","tags":["古东北族"],"brief":"见于《海外西经》与《大荒北经》的古国；历史上的肃慎为东北古族，居不咸山（长白山）之北，即后世挹娄、女真之远祖。","chapter":"dahuangbei","locationId":"buxian","image":null,"imageCount":0},{"id":"changgu","name":"长股国","n